    "https://belmont.csod.com/ux/ats/careersite/10/home/requisition/4574?c=belmont": {
      "title": "Law Library - Circulation Assistant",
      "description": "Law Library - Circulation Assistant | Job Details Sign In Create Profile English (US) Law Library - Circulation Assistant United States | req4574 Apply Now Share Save Job Posted on: 8/27/2026 Back to Search Law Library - Circulation Assistant Employment Type Student Employee Hourly Rate $13 Special Note: All students are required to read the BU Student Employment Policy prior to submitting an application. All Federal Work-Study students should read the program rules and regulations located at http://www.belmont.edu/sfs/employment/fws.html Primary Duties and Responsibilities The following are the primary tasks of Law Library - Circulation Assistant (other tasks\nmay be assigned as needed): Perform all opening and closing procedures as instructed Ensure the library is tidy (push in chairs, remove trash, etc.) Check out/in items for patrons Assist patrons as needed Regularly walk around the library to make sure all areas are kept clean and orderly Shifts that are currently be hired for: Wednesdays from 5pm-10pm Thursdays from 3pm-10pm Circulation Assistants are to remain attentive at the desk, assist all patrons as needed, and complete all assigned tasks while on shift. They are allowed to study, read, or work on whatever projects they may have while on the desk.  They are not to partake in group study with others or in long conversations.  Phone conversations should be kept to a minimum and headphones are not allowed.  Eating is allowed at the desk if there is only one person working.  Otherwise, meals should be eaten away from the desk and coordinated with the other worker to ensure one person is at the desk at all times. Required Qualifications Training provided Only applicants with FWS will be considered Required Education Must be enrolled as a law student at Belmont University College of Law. Required Experience Customer service experience preferred. Apply Now Share Save Job Belmont University is a Christ-centered community. The University fa